|| A small program in the implementation alphabet, to show each thing
|| the preprocessor does.

l̲e̲t̲ r̲e̲c̲ HCF[i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ n, m] = (m > n → HCF[m, n],
                             m = 0 → n,
                             HCF[m, Rem[n, m]])
l̲e̲t̲ a, b = 1071, 462
i̲f̲ a < b g̲o̲t̲o̲ Swap
Next: Write['The answer is ', HCF[a, b], '*n']
§1 f̲o̲r̲ i = 1, 2, ..., 5 d̲o̲
       §2 a := -a + .5
           u̲n̲l̲e̲s̲s̲ a > 0 b̲r̲e̲a̲k̲ §̸1
v̲a̲l̲u̲e̲ o̲f̲ § r̲e̲s̲u̲l̲t̲ i̲s̲ a §̸
f̲i̲n̲i̲s̲h̲
Swap: a, b := b, a
g̲o̲ t̲o̲ Next
